Error [E0927]: `#Invariant` isn't a known applied rule
  --> tests/ui/marker_retired_invariant.jet:2:2
    |
  2 | #Invariant("value >= 0 && value < 4")
    |  ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Invariant` isn't registered as an applied rule — Jet rules are a closed, registered vocabulary (I7), not any PascalCase word.
 Fix: Check the spelling, or see Docs/spec/syntax-decisions.md for the full applied-rule list.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0927
